53-| `ALLOWED_ORIGINS` | Extra origins allowed to call `/api`, comma-separated, exact match. Set to `https://localhost` for the iOS app; leave empty for the web only |
54:| `VITE_API_BASE` | Client build only, native app only: `https://<your-vercel-host>`. Empty on the web (same origin) |
